		{"id":"7116a7d457ea96d0","type":"text","text":"特征工程","x":449,"y":597,"width":120,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"5a5523c4abd0b9bc","type":"text","text":"无监督学习","x":643,"y":245,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"8bbdc673990241c5","type":"text","text":"无标注,挖掘数据中的潜在结构或模式,常见聚类和降维","x":643,"y":185,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"04a5e677093b329c","type":"text","text":"实际业务问题","x":636,"y":1182,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#d4a8ff"},
		{"id":"5cee5f65135c08b3","type":"text","text":"半监督学习","x":643,"y":-39,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"e28f676d780b5f05","type":"text","text":"大量标注,使模型输入和输出之间有映射关系,常见分类和回归","x":643,"y":-383,"width":250,"height":84,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"d5b3fead630de5fa","type":"text","text":"监督学习","x":643,"y":-299,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"c594dc0067829280","type":"text","text":"少量标注,利用未标注数据提升模型表现,常见自训练,共训练和伪标签生成","x":643,"y":-125,"width":250,"height":86,"color":"2"},
		{
			"id":"8365c76e441ec21a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"梯度下降的变体\n每次更新参数时,该用多少数据来计算梯度?\n\n| 变体              | 数据量      | 特点                     |\n| --------------- | -------- | ---------------------- |\n| 全量(BGD)         | 全部数据     | 梯度精确,稳定,但计算开销极大.       |\n| 随机(SGD)         | 1条数据     | 轻量,有随机性,但噪声大,震荡剧烈.     |\n| 小批量(Mini-Batch) | 一小批(如64) | 折中方案.能利用GPU并行,兼顾精度与效率. |\nMini-batch 已经成为深度学习训练的业界主流选择.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-480,
			"y":2380,
			"width":553,
			"height":320,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"a1490d9ecf1cdcb2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"回归问题:常见的损失函数有均方误差(MSE)和平均绝对误差(MAE). \nMSE 对异常值更敏感，而 MAE 对异常值敏感较小\n\nMSE 对异常值敏感的原因： 平方操作的放大效应: MSE 计算的是误差的平方。这意味着，即使只有一个异常值（即预测值与真实值之间存在较大差异的数据点），这个大的误差在平方后会被极大地放大。 对整体的影响: 这个被放大的误差会显著增加 MSE 的值，从而使得模型看起来表现很差。因此，MSE 会受到异常值的严重影响。\n\nMAE 对异常值不敏感的原因： 绝对值操作的线性效应: MAE 计算的是误差的绝对值。这意味着，即使存在一个异常值，其误差也会被线性地考虑进去。 平均效应: 由于所有误差都以相同的权重进行平均，因此异常值的影响会被稀释，不会像 MSE 那样对整体指标产生过大的影响。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":622,
			"y":1400,
			"width":280,
			"height":190,
			"color":"#ff42a7"
		},
		{"id":"7ec540768f3b676b","type":"text","text":"完整项目开发","x":640,"y":1270,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#d4a8ff"},
		{"id":"f73dd9adb382aef2","type":"text","text":"·原理:模型通过发现数据的内在模式或结构进行学习。常用算法包括K均值聚类、主成分分析(PCA)、自组织映射(SOM)。\n·优点:不需要标注数据,适用范围广。\n·缺点:难以评估模型效果,通常结果的可解释性较差。\n·应用:客户细分、特征提取、数据可视化等。","x":969,"y":165,"width":388,"height":220,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"3d57b007a957c1cf","type":"text","text":"在机器学习中,输入数据需要转换成某种特定的格式,叫做特征,这一过程叫特征工程。好的特征能够显著提升模型的性能。","x":695,"y":567,"width":274,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"e56c34b62abbf4e9","type":"text","text":"特征缩放(标准化, 归一化)","x":1052,"y":506,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"a44377b1a7e12d12","type":"text","text":"特征编码","x":1052,"y":597,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"dde891ed06b27604","type":"text","text":"·原理:使用少量标注数据和大量未标注数据结合的方式进行训练。可以通过生成伪标签、图表示学习等方法提升模型性能。\n·优点:在标注数据不足时,能有效利用大量未标注数据,提升模型性能。\n·缺点:模型的训练过程复杂,需要设计合理的策略来利用未标注数据。\n·应用:在标注数据获取困难或成本高的场景,如医疗影像分析、自然语言处理等。","x":969,"y":-143,"width":388,"height":268,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"2cb5108aad70c486","type":"text","text":"·原理:模型通过标注数据进行训练,学会输入输出之间的映射关系。常用算法包括线性回归、支持向量机、神经网络等。\n·优点:精度高,训练过程可以控制,误差可通过标签进行明确矫正。\n·缺点:需要大量标注数据,数据标注成本高。\n·应用:分类任务如垃圾邮件检测、回归任务如房价预测。","x":969,"y":-383,"width":388,"height":228,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"5c1ba8086414942f","type":"text","text":"特征选择","x":1052,"y":737,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{
			"id":"ccc6493fa85763e9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"· 为了防止模型过拟合,可以在损失函数中加入正则化项,如L1或L2\n正则化,将模型参数的某种度量(如绝对值和平方和)加入到损失\n函数中。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":693,
			"y":2070,
			"width":280,
			"height":180,
			"color":"#ff42a7"
		},
		{
			"id":"fb9a1c596f8cb749",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"独热编码:无大小顺序之分",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1340,
			"y":771,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"f76b9c95cebbf281",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"序数编码:保留严格顺序",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1340,
			"y":468,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"29703be3f11ce84b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"标签编码:引入数值大小(不保证顺序)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1340,
			"y":1105,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"e68b111bb16b7abb",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"· 损失函数不同于评估指标(如Accuracy、F1 Score等),虽然损失\n函数用于训练过程中的指标,但最终模型的效果还是需要通过具体\n的任务评分指标来评估。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":693,
			"y":2370,
			"width":289,
			"height":200,
			"color":"#ff42a7"
		},
		{
			"id":"2402b7e5b976e3bc",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"·特别复杂的数据分布或难解的问题,可能需要自定义损失函数。例\n如,Focal Loss用于应对类别严重不平衡问题。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":772,
			"y":1900,
			"width":295,
			"height":140,
			"color":"#ff42a7"
		},
		{
			"id":"673168d06c3a4d2f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"·损失函数提供了一个目标,使得训练模型的过程变成了一个优化问\n题,通过最小化损失函数来求解最优模型参数。\n·梯度下降法及其变种(如Adam、RMSprop等)是常用的优化算\n法,通过计算损失函数相对于模型参数的梯度来指导参数更新。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":738,
			"y":1650,
			"width":375,
			"height":220,
			"color":"#ff42a7"
		},
		{"id":"dc7dcd063a5ac8fd","type":"text","text":"Kaggle竞赛","x":649,"y":1093,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#d4a8ff"},
		{
			"id":"0068bb7ba40f6b02",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"分类问题:交叉熵损失(Cross-Entropy Loss)比较常见, 用于多类分类任务,也包括二分类.它衡量的是实际类别的概率分布和预测概率分布之间的差异.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":937,
			"y":1400,
			"width":263,
			"height":170,
			"color":"#ff42a7"
		},
		{"id":"410c6fe20ff85c8d","type":"text","text":"机器学习的两大基本任务. 分类任务是将输入数据划分到不同的离散类别中,比如垃圾邮件检测;回归任务则是预测连续值,比如股票价格预测。","x":698,"y":-582,"width":306,"height":118,"color":"1"},
		{
			"id":"ff4dc89655817ec9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"进行线性回归前,为什么需要对特征进行离散化处理",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1760,
			"y":160,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"7c996db44756b270",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## 序数编码 Ordinal Encoding\n\n将类别映射为整数，**严格保留顺序关系**（如：低=0，中=1，高=2）。\n**适用场景**：特征本身具有明确等级（如学历、满意度、舱位）。\n\n### 1. Python 代码实现\n```python\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import OrdinalEncoder\n\n# 构造模拟数据：['Low', 'Mid', 'High']\noe = OrdinalEncoder(categories=[['Low', 'Mid', 'High']]) # 显式指定顺序\ndf_ordinal['fare_cat_encoded'] = oe.fit_transform(df_ordinal[['fare_category']])",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1655,
			"y":340,
			"width":470,
			"height":256,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"02a1105728b4530f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## 独热编码 One-Hot Encoding\n\n**核心思想**：把每个类别变成独立列，用 0 和 1 表示，消除虚假的大小关系。\n**适用场景**：无序分类特征（如颜色、城市）。\n\n### 📊 编码方式对比\n\n**❌ 错误的序数编码**：模型会误以为存在大小关系（如：蓝 = 红 × 3）\n\n| 样本 | 颜色 | 编码 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| A | 🔴 红 | 1 |\n| B | 🟢 绿 | 2 |\n| C | 🔵 蓝 | 3 |\n\n**✅ 独热编码转换**：将类别映射为正交的向量，互不影响。\n\n| 样本 | 是红 | 是绿 | 是蓝 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| A | 1 | 0 | 0 |\n| B | 0 | 1 | 0 |\n| C | 0 | 0 | 1 |\n\n$$\n\\text{数学表示：} \\quad \n\\text{红} \\rightarrow \\begin{bmatrix} 1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0 \\end{bmatrix}, \\quad\n\\text{绿} \\rightarrow \\begin{bmatrix} 0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0 \\end{bmatrix}, \\quad\n\\text{蓝} \\rightarrow \\begin{bmatrix} 0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1 \\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### 💻 Python 代码实现 (Scikit-learn)\n\n```python\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import OneHotEncoder\nimport pandas as pd\n\n# 实例化编码器\n# handle_unknown='ignore': 遇到未见过的类别时不报错，直接编码为全0\n# sparse_output=False: 返回常规的 numpy 数组而不是稀疏矩阵\nohe = OneHotEncoder(handle_unknown='ignore', sparse_output=False)\n\n# 训练并转换 (输入必须是二维数组)\nohe_result = ohe.fit_transform(df_ohe[['embark_town']])\n\n# 转换为 DataFrame 并与主表拼接\nohe_columns = ohe.get_feature_names_out(['embark_town'])\nohe_df = pd.DataFrame(ohe_result, columns=ohe_columns, index=df_ohe.index)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1655,
			"y":645,
			"width":480,
			"height":320,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"2d51af5ef0f62604",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## 标签编码 Label Encoding\n\n简单映射为整数（0, 1, 2...），**不保证顺序，但引入了数值大小**。\n\n### ✅ 适用场景\n- 二分类特征（如性别，0/1等价于独热）\n- 分类任务的**目标变量/标签列**（Target Label）\n- 树模型（如 XGBoost、随机森林）\n\n### ❌ 严禁使用\n- 严禁用于**线性模型**和**多分类无序特征**！\n- 此类情况必须改用独热编码（One-Hot）或序数编码（Ordinal）。\n\n### 💻 Python 代码实现\n\n```python\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import LabelEncoder\n\nle = LabelEncoder()\nX_train_encoded['Sex'] = le.fit_transform(X_train['Sex']) \n# 内部映射关系变为：{'female': 0, 'male': 1}",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1655,
			"y":1055,
			"width":480,
			"height":265,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{"id":"70e12a427626ce3b","type":"text","text":"数据和特征决定了机器学习的上限,而模型和算法只是逼近这个上限而已","x":-100,"y":1084,"width":250,"height":128},
		{
			"id":"38efd13e7a087229",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"MAE:平均绝对误差--预测值和真实值的差的绝对值\nMSE:均方误差--预测值和真实值的差的平方\nRMSE:均方根误差--MSE开根号\nR²:决定系数--模型解释了多少目标变量和方差/波动",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2310,
			"y":-610,
			"width":330,
			"height":208,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{"id":"5a542fee899cb973","type":"text","text":"最大似然估计","x":-2247,"y":-1229,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#fb00ff"},
		{"id":"f215f896318a353a","type":"text","text":"期望和方差","x":-2247,"y":-1329,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#fb00ff"},
		{"id":"e22e9d502cd3fc19","type":"text","text":"概率基础(条件概率,贝叶斯定理)","x":-2247,"y":-1529,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#fb00ff"},
		{"id":"4a36baeed363e96b","type":"text","text":"常见分布(正态分布,伯努利分布)","x":-2247,"y":-1429,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#fb00ff"},
		{"id":"6d691929f3a28560","type":"text","text":"特征值和特征向量","x":-2247,"y":-1629,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#fb00ff"},
		{"id":"9e11a7abd867986f","type":"text","text":"矩阵的秩和行列式","x":-2247,"y":-1729,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#fb00ff"},
		{"id":"1c69e2d397c8c184","type":"text","text":"矩阵运算","x":-2247,"y":-1829,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#fb00ff"},
		{"id":"94f045702b1841ed","type":"text","text":"向量和矩阵","x":-2247,"y":-1929,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#fb00ff"},
		{"id":"c696f3886bf97511","type":"text","text":"链式法则","x":-2247,"y":-2029,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#fb00ff"},
		{
			"id":"0a072cf5ac373227",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"测试集",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2960,
			"y":-1143,
			"width":130,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"84247df7d6fb1c33",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"折1:测试集",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2960,
			"y":-1063,
			"width":130,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"dac3e6e74a9d0892",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"数据",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3190,
			"y":-1143,
			"width":80,
			"height":60,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"f9d547d44c484f99",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"折2:测试集",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2970,
			"y":-971,
			"width":130,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"2bc77bea766e845b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## 一、准确率（Accuracy）\n\n核心问题：所有样本中，模型预测正确的比例是多少？\n\n公式：\n\n$$\n[ Accuracy=\\frac{TP+TN}{TP+TN+FP+FN} ]\n$$\n\n代入数据：\n\n$$\n[ Accuracy=\\frac{32+48}{100}=80\\% ]\n$$\n\n这说明模型在 100 个样本中，正确预测了 80 个。\n\n优点： 容易理解，可以直观地衡量整体预测正确率。\n\n缺点： 当正负样本数量差距很大时，准确率可能具有误导性。\n\n例如，1000 个样本中只有 10 个恶性病例。如果模型把所有病例都预测为良性，那么准确率仍然有 99%，但它一个恶性病例都没有识别出来。\n\n因此，在类别不平衡、漏报代价较高的任务中，不能只看准确率。\n\n## 二、精确率（Precision）\n\n核心问题：所有被模型预测为正类的样本中，有多少是真的正类？\n\n公式：\n\n$$\n[ Precision=\\frac{TP}{TP+FP} ]\n$$\n\n代入数据：\n\n$$\n[ Precision=\\frac{32}{32+8}=80\\% ]\n$$\n\n模型一共预测了 40 个恶性病例，其中 32 个确实是恶性，因此精确率为 80%。\n\n精确率关注的是误报（FP）。\n\n- 精确率高：模型预测为正类的结果通常比较可靠。\n    \n- 精确率低：模型容易把负类误判为正类。\n    \n\n例如，在垃圾邮件识别中，如果把正常邮件错判为垃圾邮件，会导致用户错过重要信息。此时就需要关注精确率。\n\n## 三、召回率（Recall）\n\n召回率也叫查全率（有时称敏感度，Sensitivity）。\n\n核心问题：所有真实的正类样本中，模型成功找出了多少？\n\n公式：\n\n$$\n[ Recall=\\frac{TP}{TP+FN} ]\n$$\n\n代入数据：\n\n$$\n[ Recall=\\frac{32}{32+12}\\approx72.73\\% ]\n$$\n\n真实的恶性病例共有 44 个，模型只识别出 32 个，剩余 12 个被漏报。\n\n召回率关注的是漏报（FN）。\n\n- 召回率高：能够识别出更多真实正类。\n    \n- 召回率低：有更多正类被遗漏。\n    \n\n在恶性肿瘤筛查等场景中，漏报可能延误进一步检查，因此通常需要重点关注召回率。不过，实际医疗决策还需要结合特异度、误报代价及后续检查能力综合判断。\n\n## 四、F1 值（F1-score）\n\n核心问题：如何综合评价精确率和召回率？\n\n精确率和召回率有时会互相制约。模型如果更积极地预测正类，通常可以减少漏报、提高召回率，但也可能增加误报、降低精确率。\n\nF1 值使用精确率与召回率的调和平均数，综合衡量两者。\n\n$$\n[ F1=2\\times\\frac{Precision\\times Recall}{Precision+Recall} ]\n$$\n\n代入上面的数据：\n\n$$\n[ F1=2\\times\\frac{0.8\\times0.7273}{0.8+0.7273} \\approx76.19\\% ]\n$$\n\n为什么使用调和平均数，而不是普通平均数？\n\n因为调和平均数对较小的数值更加敏感。如果精确率很高，但召回率很低，F1 值也会受到明显影响。\n\n例如：\n\n|精确率|召回率|F1 值|\n|---|---|---|\n|90%|90%|90%|\n|90%|30%|45%|\n|50%|50%|50%|\n\n理解重点： F1 值越高，说明精确率和召回率的综合表现越好，但它不能反映所有业务代价，也不直接考虑真负例（TN）。\n\n如果任务更看重精确率或召回率，可以进一步了解带权重的 \\(F_\\beta\\) 指标。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2735,
			"y":-1172,
			"width":400,
			"height":201,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{"id":"36a4bde9a07a66d6","type":"file","file":"image/Pasted image 20261020111936.png","x":-2760,"y":-895,"width":290,"height":243,"color":"4"},
		{
			"id":"26b1e824d4f97316",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## ROC 曲线与 AUC\n\n精确率/召回率依赖于决策阈值。**ROC 曲线**通过遍历所有阈值，完整展示模型表现：\n\n- **横轴 (FPR)**: 假正率（False Positive Rate），负类被误判为正类的比例。\n- **纵轴 (TPR)**: 真正率（True Positive Rate / 召回率），正类被正确识别的比例。\n\n### AUC (Area Under Curve)\nROC 曲线下面积，取值 \\(0 \\sim 1\\)。\\(\\text{AUC}\\) 越大，模型区分正负类的能力越强，且与阈值无关，适合模型间横向对比。\n\n$$\n\\text{AUC} \\in [0, 1]\n$$",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2455,
			"y":-890,
			"width":310,
			"height":238,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{"id":"4089191730281d55","type":"text","text":"梯度和梯度下降","x":-2247,"y":-2129,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#fb00ff"},
		{"id":"f228f0854007c995","type":"text","text":"导数和偏导数","x":-2247,"y":-2229,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#fb00ff"},
		{"id":"47cbc4bb1e8d8fa7","type":"text","text":"过拟合是模型在训练集上表现很好, 但在测试集上表现差;欠拟合是模型在训练集和测试集上表现不好","x":-2230,"y":-289,"width":250,"height":110,"color":"4"},
		{
			"id":"ebec0fd26a555b4a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"降低模型复杂度\n使用更简单的模型(如减少多项式阶数或树的深度)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2990,
			"y":-240,
			"width":260,
			"height":80,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"fb767a1d17d54585",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"如何解决过拟合\n核心思路:让模型别太极端(做减法)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2600,
			"y":-210,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{"id":"8e1b9125edd4555c","type":"text","text":"正则化\n给模型复杂度加惩罚,限制权重大小,防止死记硬背","x":-2990,"y":-354,"width":250,"height":94,"color":"4"},
		{
			"id":"31e5ba848edc2a2f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"特征选择\n主动去掉无关或冗余的特征,减少干扰信号",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2990,
			"y":-140,
			"width":260,
			"height":80,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"8722229902e5887a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"早停(Early Stopping)\n在验证集误差开始上升时,即使停止训练过程",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2990,
			"y":-40,
			"width":260,
			"height":80,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"fd799732614349e0",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"L2正则化\n惩罚所有权重的绝对值之和:\n![](../../../image/Pasted%20image%2020261014153316.png)\n将不重要特征的权重直接压缩到0,相当于自动进行特征选择.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3320,
			"y":-280,
			"width":280,
			"height":180,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"d359ee7a57062657",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Dropout/数据增强\n深度学中的常用防过拟合高级技巧",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2990,
			"y":60,
			"width":260,
			"height":80,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"5407227ca419d9ea",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"训练集",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2960,
			"y":-1219,
			"width":130,
			"height":60,
			"color":"6"
		},
		{
			"id":"8248f04014e9195a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"...",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2970,
			"y":-811,
			"width":130,
			"height":60,
			"color":"6"
		},
		{"id":"1f3b1b69893768af","type":"text","text":"SVM原理","x":597,"y":-1572,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#004cff"},
		{"id":"2b2a6251a2a94ccd","type":"text","text":"K-means","x":597,"y":-1292,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#004cff"},
		{"id":"09cebdc2204c364f","type":"text","text":"软间隔","x":597,"y":-1392,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#004cff"},
		{"id":"935da91c06883ad9","type":"text","text":"核函数","x":597,"y":-1472,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#004cff"},
		{"id":"34195d5e77db81ce","type":"text","text":"贝叶斯定理","x":597,"y":-887,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#004cff"},
		{
			"id":"10b3d74e479bdc48",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"增加训练数据\n更多数据让噪声被稀释(数据获取成本低时)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2995,
			"y":-474,
			"width":255,
			"height":94,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"98c1622551e3242d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"L1正则化\n惩罚所有权重的平方和:\n![](../../../image/Pasted%20image%2020261014153211.png)\n将权重均匀压缩到接近0的最小值,但不会恰好等于0.表现稳定",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3320,
			"y":-520,
			"width":280,
			"height":200,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"e279d14c086e9478",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"数据",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3200,
			"y":-937,
			"width":80,
			"height":60,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"6eed432cd8235d51",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"折3:测试集",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2970,
			"y":-891,
			"width":130,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{"id":"03d6231dbeb9242b","type":"text","text":"· 应用:主要用于分类问题。比如文本分类、垃圾邮件过滤等。\n· 优点:简单高效,适合高维数据。\n· 缺点:假设特征之间独立,现实中并不总是成立。","x":952,"y":-827,"width":250,"height":227,"color":"#004cff"},
		{"id":"3df57a2bac8e94c8","type":"text","text":"XGBoost, LightGBM","x":604,"y":-1669,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#004cff"},
		{"id":"098bb63541a2e2bd","type":"text","text":"GBDT(梯度|提升决策树)","x":604,"y":-1749,"width":250,"height":51,"color":"#004cff"},
		{"id":"fa93039aa5d139e3","type":"text","text":"层次聚类","x":597,"y":-1212,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#004cff"},
		{"id":"4f2841d272b002f7","type":"text","text":"PCA (主成分分析)","x":597,"y":-1119,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#004cff"},
		{"id":"8a2fc48f6b1a9083","type":"text","text":"t-SNE","x":597,"y":-1029,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#004cff"},
		{"id":"32ea0b847dab4182","type":"text","text":"· 应用:用于非监督学习中的聚类分析。比如图像分割、客户分群等。\n· 优点:理解和实现简单,计算速度快。\n缺点:需要预先确定聚类数K,对初始值敏感。","x":1021,"y":-1160,"width":250,"height":204,"color":"#004cff"},
		{"id":"b9b28c94dc5bcc69","type":"text","text":"·应用:主要用于分类问题,能够处理线性和非线性数据。比如图像、文本分类等。\n·优点:能够找到分类决策边界的最大化间隔,泛化能力强。\n·缺点:对大规模数据不友好,训练时间长,适合于小样本。","x":1000,"y":-1580,"width":250,"height":276,"color":"#004cff"},
		{
			"id":"1b5e3d7392b7f074",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"K-Means 的迭代流程\nK-Means 的核心就是不断循环:选中心→分簇→更新中心→再分簇→直到稳定。\n\n1.初始化质心:预先指定K,随机选取K个初始中心点。\n2.分配样本:计算每个样本到各质心的距离,划分到距离最近的簇中。\n3.更新质心:根据当前簇中的所有样本,重新计算该簇的中心点(均值)。\n4.重复迭代:重新分配样本并更新质心,不断循环。\n5.收敛停止:当质心位置不再变化、样本归属不再改变,或达到最大迭代次数时停止。\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1310,
			"y":-1080,
			"width":260,
			"height":124
		},
		{"id":"28a28a8c4bc733fb","type":"text","text":"K近邻(KNN)算法\n· 应用:用于分类和回归问题。比如推荐系统、图像识别等。\n· 优点:理论上实现简单,不需要训练过程。\n· 缺点:计算量大,预测时间长,尤其是大数据集。","x":1420,"y":-1392,"width":300,"height":232,"color":"#004cff"},
		{"id":"539a836c7c6059f1","type":"text","text":"· 应用:降维,特征提取。比如数据可视化。\n· 优点:可以有效减少数据的维度,保留主要特征信息。\n· 缺点:信息损失,不易解释。\n","x":1271,"y":-857,"width":274,"height":177,"color":"#004cff"},
		{"id":"035694d99bc0c8e6","type":"text","text":"决策树(ID3, C4.5, CART)","x":604,"y":-1909,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#004cff"},
		{"id":"5ce4105c89066e7c","type":"text","text":"随机森林","x":604,"y":-1828,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#004cff"},
		{"id":"c8c047914de6402e","type":"text","text":"·应用:主要用于回归问题,也就是预测一个连续的数值输出。比如房价预测、销量\n预测等。\n·优点:简单直观,训练速度快。\n·缺点:仅适用于线性关系的数据,对非线性关系无法处理。","x":1000,"y":-2363,"width":271,"height":234,"color":"#004cff"},
		{"id":"7df9b0137e23ba16","type":"text","text":"逻辑回归","x":604,"y":-2144,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#004cff"},
		{
			"id":"729049078d569715",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"没有隐藏层的单层神经网络",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":604,
			"y":-2084,
			"width":250,
			"height":60
		},
		{"id":"d6860a1c29ee7030","type":"text","text":"岭(Ridge)回归/L2正则化和lasso回归/L1正则化\n","x":604,"y":-2009,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#004cff"},
		{"id":"d37078173965035f","type":"text","text":"线性回归","x":604,"y":-2306,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#004cff"},
		{
			"id":"0275da7adca2a42f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"核心概念:纯度\n衡量纯度的指标: \n1.熵与信息增益\n熵值最高最混乱,熵值为0,最纯净\n信息增益 = 分裂前的熵 - 分裂后的熵\n信息增益越大,说明特征区分能力越强\n2.基尼系数(Gini Impurity)(工业界更倾向使用)\n![](../../../image/Pasted%20image%2020261014161021.png)\n直观理解:随机从节点中抽取两个样本,它们属于不同类别的概率。\n· 基尼系数越小,说明节点越纯(完全纯净时为0)。\n· 计算极快:只有乘法和加法,没有耗时的对数运算。\n· 工业标准:是scikit-learn库中决策树(CART算法)的默认指标。\n\n决策树的生长过程\n构建决策树是一个不断寻找最优特征进行划分的递归流程:\n\n1.计算指标:计算当前节点使用各项特征划分后的基尼系数。\n2.选择最优:选择划分后基尼系数最小(纯度提升最大)的特征。\n3.分裂数据:按该特征的不同取值,将数据分裂成子节点。\n4.递归生长:对每个子节点重复上述过程,继续向下生长。\n5.生成叶节点:满足停止条件时停止分裂,确定最终预测结果。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1970,
			"y":-1946,
			"width":260,
			"height":340,
			"color":"#1430ff"
		},
		{"id":"ef5a2a43a1bfc1ec","type":"text","text":"·应用:主要用于二分类问题,预测一个样本属于某一类的概率。比如广告点击率预\n测、垃圾邮件分类等。\n·优点:概率输出,解释性强。\n·缺点:对于非线性的问题,需要进行特征工程或者使用核函数。","x":1000,"y":-2084,"width":271,"height":210,"color":"#004cff"},
		{"id":"a9e0867e3031ac41","type":"text","text":"朴素贝叶斯分类器","x":597,"y":-792,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#004cff"},
		{
			"id":"2de508efa44be669",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"剪枝(Pruning):防止过拟合\n如果任由决策树肆意生长,它会为了把每一个异常值都分对,长出无数繁琐的分支,导致过拟合。我们需要剪掉多余细节,保留核心主干。\n\n1. 预剪枝(Pre-pruning)\n在树往下生长的过程中,提前设定规则,触及规则强制停止。\n· 限制最大深度(max_depth)\n· 限制叶节点最少样本数\n✅️实现简单、计算量小,工业界广泛使用。\n\n2.后剪枝(Post-pruning)\n先让树毫无保留地生长到最大,然后再从下往上检查,剪掉不影响准确率的分支。\n✅️理论效果更好,但大数据下计算成本高。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2290,
			"y":-1946,
			"width":260,
			"height":380,
			"color":"#1430ff"
		},
		{"id":"e472c8b5b33e22c2","type":"text","text":"[scikit-learn: machine learning in Python — scikit-learn 1.9.1 documentation](https://scikit-learn.org/stable/index.html)","x":-867,"y":-1463,"width":399,"height":60},
		{"id":"a94994840a69dc0e","type":"text","text":"大模型主要是分类算法","x":-418,"y":-1433,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#004cff"},
		{"id":"4a152db3a1b71453","type":"text","text":"支持向量机","x":243,"y":-1479,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#004cff"},
		{"id":"65e77728baa6fd5d","type":"text","text":"聚类算法","x":237,"y":-1251,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#004cff"},
		{"id":"96713041e123e118","type":"text","text":"降维算法","x":243,"y":-1066,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#004cff"},
		{"id":"78c43c4e307ef531","type":"text","text":"朴素贝叶斯","x":243,"y":-894,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#004cff"},
		{"id":"1a07188381034d92","type":"text","text":"分类与回归","x":423,"y":-553,"width":140,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"f2992f8df80d5a76","type":"text","text":"·应用:用于分类和回归问题。比如市场策略的决策制定、疾病诊断等。\n· 优点:可以处理非线性数据,易于解释。\n·缺点:容易过拟合,需要修剪。\n总结:核心优势\n\n用 样本随机+特征随机 制造多样性,再用 集体投票 消除个体偏差。\n它未必是精度最高的模型,但几乎总是最值得首先尝试的那一个。\n· 抗过拟合能力强:极大降低了模型的方差。\n· 极简的数据预处理:无需归一化,能处理缺失值,对异常值不敏感。\n· 高维数据友好:从容应对成千上万特征,无需显式降维。\n· 附赠特征重要性:自然输出特征贡献度,利于业务归因分析。\n· 天然支持并行计算:树的生成完全独立,完美利用多核CPU加速。","x":1640,"y":-1946,"width":280,"height":337,"color":"#1430ff"},
		{"id":"de62fc207e74a83b","type":"text","text":"· 应用:用于分类和回归问题。比如预测顾客忠诚度、信用评分等。\n·优点:集成多棵决策树,减小过拟合问题,效果较好。\n· 缺点:对于高维数据,计算资源消耗较大。","x":1350,"y":-1722,"width":250,"height":202,"color":"#1430ff"},
		{
			"id":"bb2a7ec2e5d26f69",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"反向传播＋梯度下降:深度学习训练的核心引擎",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-976,
			"y":-98,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"5"
		},
		{"id":"55e1e8048a8a339d","type":"text","text":"深度学习与神经网络","x":-911,"y":-38,"width":195,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"b0364642c48eec4b","type":"file","file":"image/Pasted image 20261012090109.png","x":-867,"y":-1396,"width":400,"height":192},
		{"id":"357f54824eee7bb5","type":"text","text":"经典机器学习算法,scikit-learn","x":-420,"y":-1300,"width":296,"height":50,"color":"#004cff"},
		{
			"id":"cd0dfb7b572327d2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"记住:机器学习不是魔法! 好的模型 = 70%数据质量 + 20%特征工程 + 10%模型选择与调优",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-480,
			"y":-158,
			"width":260,
			"height":120,
			"color":"#ff0000"
		},
		{"id":"e1e1e6cf57378c92","type":"text","text":"基础概念\npython详见此前目录","x":-470,"y":18,"width":250,"height":96},
		{"id":"16db29a4f039c54d","type":"text","text":"机器学习","x":-340,"y":-42,"width":120,"height":60,"color":"#4c73e6"},
		{"id":"8901b75d71790836","type":"text","text":"非监督学习算法","x":-200,"y":-1059,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#004cff"},
		{"id":"b51c0848aa0ea1ea","type":"file","file":"LLM/2-Source/7-Machine Learning/无监督学习.md","x":-367,"y":-969,"width":464,"height":400},
		{"id":"d02f562bd3e99e2e","type":"text","text":"训练集(60%-80%):训练模型,学习数据中的规律\n验证集(10%-20%):调整超参数,评估模型在未见过数据上的表现\n测试集(10%-20%):模拟真实世界数据,最终评估模型泛化能力\n\n防止数据泄露(Data Leakage)原则:\n所有fit操作只在训练集上进行,测试集只做transform.","x":-200,"y":-523,"width":280,"height":303},
		{"id":"c544de9058f5e422","type":"text","text":"反向传播","x":-1620,"y":157,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"c66cf575351109b1","type":"text","text":"激活函数","x":-1620,"y":240,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"26140227a85e9eb3","type":"text","text":"[LLM/2-Source/8-Deep Learning/Deep Learning.canvas](obsidian://open?vault=LLM&file=LLM%2F2-Source%2F8-Deep%20Learning%2FDeep%20Learning.canvas)","x":-1569,"y":-187,"width":250,"height":129,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"86a48d6f163a8cd3","type":"text","text":"感知机","x":-1620,"y":-13,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"78c109b311ffbcf5","type":"text","text":"多层感知机","x":-1620,"y":67,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"625b97ad35c14812","type":"text","text":"框架基础","x":-1620,"y":330,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"ae8bfcd26a213679","type":"text","text":"在高级机器学习中,深度学习尤为重要。深度学习利用多层神经网络来自动学习复杂的特征,并在图像识别、自然语言处理等领域取得了巨大成功。","x":-1282,"y":-207,"width":250,"height":169,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"20a4761a510681e5","type":"text","text":"监督学习与无监督学习","x":0,"y":-38,"width":220,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"b21dc543eb46049d","type":"file","file":"image/Pasted image 20261013082046.png","x":-22,"y":76,"width":400,"height":205},
		{"id":"0d4c22eb2666f350","type":"text","text":"机器学习重要的两种类型。监督学习是指模型在训练时需要给定明确的输入-输出对,比如学生在老师的指导下学习;无监督学习则是模型要从没有标签的数据中寻找模式,比如聚类任务。","x":283,"y":-93,"width":280,"height":169,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"8dabd0be189d3712","type":"text","text":"偏差和方差","x":-1940,"y":-344,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"b7ad06741b833088","type":"text","text":"回归问题:MSE, RMSE, MAE, R²","x":-1940,"y":-593,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"06afa116fd08c5fc","type":"text","text":"交叉验证","x":-1940,"y":-504,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"44c73d11125ecdc7","type":"text","text":"过拟合和欠拟合","x":-1940,"y":-424,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"dd0359bb1c3e8c42","type":"text","text":"分类问题:准确率, 精确率,召回率, F1值, ROC曲线","x":-1940,"y":-682,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"103749451150d50d","type":"text","text":"评估一个机器学习模型的好坏,通常采用交叉验证方法,通过划分训练集和测试集来衡量模型的性能。此外,常见的评估指标有准确率、召回率、F1分数等。","x":-1593,"y":-593,"width":250,"height":173,"color":"4"},
		{
			"id":"9ba06e2d6fa5c93b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"先把Baseline跑起来\n在深入评估前,我们需要一个可靠的起点.\nBaseline(基线模型)是指首个快速实现,相对简单但具备完整流程的模型\n它的核心价值不在于极致精度,而在于建立参照系--后续所有的优化尝试,都需要以此为基准进行对比.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1207,
			"y":-464,
			"width":340,
			"height":204,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{"id":"8433173d0f609cbd","type":"text","text":"神经网络基础","x":-1282,"y":97,"width":244,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"de273941c28c4c39","type":"text","text":"Pytorch/TensorFlow","x":-1220,"y":300,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"ea7103a37a289ac6","type":"text","text":"应用场景","x":-1032,"y":537,"width":121,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"a56b3a70994aea88","type":"text","text":"线性代数\n3Blue1Brown\n[【官方双语/合集】线性代数的本质 - 系列合集_哔哩哔哩_bilibili](https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ys411472E/?vd_source=629cf77d2500705db66282e48a133408)\n\n深度学习的数学\n(详见Book目录下)","x":-1854,"y":-1868,"width":250,"height":250,"color":"#fb00ff"},
		{"id":"58cc338593cacc29","type":"text","text":"具体问题具体分析,选择合适的评估指标. 比如在不平衡数据集上, 准确率可能不是好指标, 应该使用F1值","x":-1117,"y":-660,"width":250,"height":116,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"84449ffdbeedad50","type":"text","text":"模型评估与验证","x":-1093,"y":-524,"width":169,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{
			"id":"2260bce94d6138ba",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"线性回归的重要性\n\n到这里,我们已经掌握了线性回归的大部分核心知识。线性回归是整个机器学习乃至深度学习的基本原子:\n· 逻辑回归不过是在线性回归的输出上套了一个激活函数;\n· 深度学习的本质是将多个线性回归通过非线性函数层层相连;\n· 即便是大语言模型,其核心运算依然可以理解为多元线性回归的大规模批量处理。\n\n万变不离其宗,把线性回归真正吃透,后面的学习就是在这个地基上不断叠加新结构。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-940,
			"y":-2020,
			"width":472,
			"height":320,
			"color":"#00ff9d"
		},
		{"id":"01990feed6f089c4","type":"text","text":"微积分","x":-1854,"y":-2129,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#fb00ff"},
		{"id":"0bc34b312ee0c1a9","type":"file","file":"LLM/2-Source/7-Machine Learning/监督学习.md","x":-345,"y":-2099,"width":442,"height":291},
		{"id":"482080a26f39f078","type":"text","text":"监督学习算法","x":-200,"y":-1788,"width":250,"height":50,"color":"#004cff"},
		{
			"id":"957e605a98c9263b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Bagging vs Boosting\n\n集成学习有两大主流思想,目标都是把一群弱模型组合成一个强模型,但实现路径截然不同。\nBagging:少数服从多数\n· 有放回采样:给每棵树准备一份不同的训练数\n据;随机选特征,让每棵树学到不同的视角。\n· 最终投票/平均:综合所有树意见给出结果。\n· 代表算法:随机森林\n\nBoosting:接力纠错\n· 串行训练:树依次训练,一棵接一棵。\n· 专注错误:每棵新树专注于前面树犯的错。\n· 累加预测:最终所有树的预测累加起来。\n· 代表算法:XGBoost、LightGBM、CatBoost",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":243,
			"y":-1719,
			"width":250,
			"height":161
		},
		{"id":"7ae5066e40f24de4","type":"text","text":"决策树和集成学习","x":243,"y":-1798,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#004cff"},
		{"id":"9dfaf676b812c09c","type":"text","text":"线性模型","x":243,"y":-2039,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#004cff"}
	],
